<title>USA: U.S. orange production estimates-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange production estimates-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA orange production estimates (crop in 1,000 boxes, yield in gallons/box at 42.0 degrees Brix basis):</p>
<p>				    1996/97:	    Indicated</p>
<p>    -			May 1	Prev.Est.    1995/96</p>
<p> Florida Oranges     224,200	 221,200     203,200</p>
<p> Florida Temples	 2,400	   2,500	 2,150</p>
<p> Fla. FCOJ Yield	  1.58	    1.57	  1.52</p>
<p> U.S. Oranges	  297,920	 294,920     271,790</p>
<p>Note-U.S. oranges and Florida oranges exclude temples.</p>
</text>
